<!-- NewApi findings on the patched tree that are safe on API 22. Applied only by
     LINT=1 builds (scripts/lint-newapi.gradle). Every entry says why; anything else NewApi
     reports fails tier 1. Keep entries narrow: match the exact API, never a whole file. -->
<lint>
